title: Sophos Firewall: IPsec connections
agents: snmp
catalog: hw/network/sophos
license: GPLv2
distribution: https://github.com/KeksDipp/checkmk-plugins
item:
 The name of the IPsec connection.

description:
 Status of an IPsec connection (sfosIPSecVpnTunnelTable) and the number of
 active tunnels (child SAs).

 Activated and connected: {OK}. Activated but down: {CRIT}. Partially active:
 {WARN}. Deactivated by the administrator: {OK}. All states and optional lower
 levels for the active tunnels are configurable via the rule
 "Sophos Firewall IPsec connections".

 The table has no traffic counters. Throughput of route-based VPNs is
 available on the xfrm interfaces in the interface check.

discovery:
 One service is created for each IPsec connection.
